sequenceDiagram
  participant Client
  participant API as NestJS
  participant Auth as Better Auth
  participant Authz as Authorization
  participant DB as PostgreSQL + RLS

  Client->>API: Request + Bearer token + org selector
  API->>Auth: Validate session
  Auth-->>API: Global user identity
  API->>Authz: Check org relationship + permission
  Authz-->>API: Authorized
  API->>DB: Begin transaction
  API->>DB: SET LOCAL tenant context
  API->>DB: Tenant-scoped query
  DB->>DB: Apply RLS policy
  DB-->>API: Scoped result
  API->>DB: Commit
  API-->>Client: Response
